{"id":"n56790-1-8","stage":5,"title":"밑창 · 鞋底","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56790-1-8-1","ko":"구두 새로 샀어?","zh":"你新买了鞋吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"구두","meaning":"皮鞋","explanation":"구두：皮鞋","readings":[{"term":"구두","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26805","senseId":"1","lemma":"구두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0053d9a290561503","term":"구두","zh":"皮鞋","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3","entryId":"26805","definition":"穿正装时所穿的由皮革、塑料等制成的鞋。","pronunciation":["구두"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"重新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"与以前不同，全新地；或用新的。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7fa69cc5fcb3517cafe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56790-1-8-2","ko":"아니. 밑창만 갈았는데 새것처럼 보이나 봐.","zh":"没有。只是换了鞋底，看起来却像新的一样呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밑창만","meaning":"鞋底","explanation":"밑창：鞋底；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"밑창","audio":"/audio/61ae80f43578d40db2ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56790","senseId":"1","lemma":"밑창","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈았는데","meaning":"换，更换","explanation":"갈다：换，更换；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"갈다","audio":"/audio/5e94c618238a75a7c497.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59937","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새것처럼","meaning":"新的","explanation":"새것：新的；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"새것","audio":"/audio/27bd79f69956a077149a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83551","senseId":"3","lemma":"새것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이나","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"61ae80f43578d40d","term":"밑창","zh":"鞋底","audio":"/audio/61ae80f43578d40db2ac.mp3","entryId":"56790","definition":"贴在鞋子底部的皮革或橡胶。","pronunciation":["믿창"]},{"id":"5e94c618238a75a7","term":"갈다","zh":"换，更换","audio":"/audio/5e94c618238a75a7c497.mp3","entryId":"59937","definition":"收起原来的东西，在那个位置放上别的东西作为替代。","pronunciation":["갈다"]},{"id":"27bd79f69956a077","term":"새것","zh":"新的","audio":"/audio/27bd79f69956a077149a.mp3","entryId":"83551","definition":"还没变旧、 状态如初的东西。","pronunciation":["새걷"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","a